␀␀␀
Options: move whole folders off the card (e.g. a second card for N-Z),
␀␀use a one-copy-per-title library (prep_library.py --mode library --1g1r),
␀or BIGDISK=OFF if it is ON (smaller disk buffer, more room for the list).
␀To load the first ~%u games instead of stopping, add LIBLIMIT=OFF to CONFIG.TXT.
